{"data":{"id":"wBuo4DReajA","slug":"ashanti","title":"Ashanti","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"wl1ML3g67Gk","slug":"foolish-starro-remix","title":"Foolish (starRo Remix)"},{"id":"6EUKDFT6Xzk","slug":"happy","title":"Happy"},{"id":"MCvboiYUptc","slug":"baby","title":"Baby"},{"id":"p2LluJH7EfA","slug":"rain-on-me","title":"Rain On Me"},{"id":"3WoYHRmkeXk","slug":"hey-baby-starro-remix","title":"Hey Baby (starRo remix)"},{"id":"nV2Jn8Mw0Is","slug":"foolish","title":"Foolish"}]},"markers":[{"id":"UU6p6TAp8ag","position":9,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ashanti - Foolish","track":{"id":"nV2Jn8Mw0Is","path":"/artists/ashanti/tracks/foolish/","slug":"foolish","title":"Foolish","artist":{"slug":"ashanti","title":"Ashanti"},"artwork":"images/artists/ashanti/tracks/foolish.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"o8Ex2lZ5Fzw","slug":"soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021","tags":[10,3,10],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/mekyle/sets/soulection-chill-2021-discord"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection & Chill (Discord Edition)","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021.png","content":"\nCuddle up and chill out with a discord edition of Soulection & Chill.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [@nowayjosue#6118](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#nowayjosue#6118) - Los Angeles 🇺🇸\n- [@Tatoun#4071](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#tatoun#4071) - Paris 🇫🇷\n- [@SelaVie#5052](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#selavie#5052) - Toronto 🇨🇦\n- [@KNVL.#7556](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#knvl.#7556) - Kenya 🇰🇪\n- [@Kari’m#9263](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#karim#9263) - Detroit 🇺🇸\n- [@ChinoStaySolow#8122](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#chinostaysolow#8122) - Providence 🇺🇸\n- [@KEVLAR REX#5427](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#kevlar-rex#5427) - Atlanta 🇺🇸\n- [@hiimjae#7572](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#hiimjae#7572)\n- [@DjQueRico#9286](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#djquerico#9286) - Knoxville 🇺🇸\n\n\nArtwork by [joemaloof#3534](https://www.instagram.com/jjjjoemaloof/)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-02-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"@nowayjosue#6118","position":0}},{"id":"4eDGB9-qS3I","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ashanti - Hey Baby (starRo remix)","track":{"id":"3WoYHRmkeXk","path":"/artists/ashanti/tracks/hey-baby-starro-remix/","slug":"hey-baby-starro-remix","title":"Hey Baby (starRo remix)","artist":{"slug":"ashanti","title":"Ashanti"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zg_8tfPfypk","slug":"144","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-144-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #144 w/ starRo","artwork":"/images/episodes/144.jpg","content":"\nstarRo hails all the way from Tokyo, Japan to play original productions and edits.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere have been so many guests on Soulection Radio over the past years but no one, we repeat, no one has came in the studio so humble, so low key and just murk the airwaves like starRo did. \nIt's crazy to think that this man has been making music for over 15 years and is barely coming to surface to the world with so much heat. \nWe are just glad he is on our team. He played nothing but original production/edits. \nHailing all the way from Tokyo, Japan, starRo is an artist who you will be familiar with starting from this point on. \nJoe Kay of course opened the show for the first hour & 50 minutes on one turntable (one of the turntable's went out before the show started) playing a bunch of heat that he was holding onto since last week. \nHe made sure to make up for his absence last saturday and play some exclusive Carmack, Atu, Kaytra, Esta, Esgar, Jo Def + some other heavy footwork vibes.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"starRo's Set","position":1}},{"id":"GeKv7po2BxU","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ashanti - Foolish (starRo Remix","track":{"id":"wl1ML3g67Gk","path":"/artists/ashanti/tracks/foolish-starro-remix/","slug":"foolish-starro-remix","title":"Foolish (starRo Remix)","artist":{"slug":"ashanti","title":"Ashanti"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"t26W25WELwY","slug":"190","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-190-w-esta"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #190 w/ Esta","artwork":"/images/episodes/190.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10834,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"3GY6nhPl-E4","position":7,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ashanti - Happy","track":{"id":"6EUKDFT6Xzk","path":"/artists/ashanti/tracks/happy/","slug":"happy","title":"Happy","artist":{"slug":"ashanti","title":"Ashanti"},"artwork":"images/artists/ashanti/tracks/happy.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"E8VhqhMmtVM","slug":"260","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-260/ra.1114969022","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-260-live-from-atlanta-georgia"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #260 (Live From Atlanta, Georgia)","artwork":"/images/episodes/260.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7270,"location":"US","published_at":"2016-05-21T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"MSW-zr9QCnE","position":18,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ashanti - Baby","track":{"id":"MCvboiYUptc","path":"/artists/ashanti/tracks/baby/","slug":"b